AIOStreams TV (packages/tizen-tv)

This package is part of AIOStreams (AGPL-3.0). Parts of its architecture and
code are adapted from samsucks, https://github.com/rfaile313/samsucks,
licensed GPL-3.0. GPLv3 section 13 permits combining the two works. Each adapted
file carries the header comment
  "Adapted from samsucks (https://github.com/rfaile313/samsucks), GPL-3.0".

Adapted from samsucks (raw files at the HEAD of its default branch):
  app/js/input.js            rAF-coalesced remote input, html.fast, text-input passthrough
  app/js/router.js           screen stack with hidden-but-mounted screens
  app/js/platform/tizen.js   key map, key registration, exit, screensaver
  app/js/util/dom.js         no-op-skipping DOM write helpers (h() signature changed)
  app/js/util/store.js       localStorage JSON wrapper (prefix changed)
  app/js/util/format.js      meta-line/duration helpers (reworked for Jellyfin DTOs)
  app/css/app.css            design tokens, nav, row, tile, ring, focus styles
Later phases will add (and list here when they do): ui/row.js, ui/grid.js,
ui/tile.js, ui/images.js, ui/backdrop.js, screens layouts.

Not adapted: branding. There is no "SamSUCKS" mascot or wordmark here.

